  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To coordinate the Global Pathways to Prosperity programme Linking and Learning agenda this project provides space and resources to 1) allow for learning, innovation and exchange on a selected key thematic areas in line with our programmatic strategic considerations; 2) optimise Monitoring and Evaluation systems in our Programme Management cycles; and 3) ensure access and disclose information and data internally and externally.</narrative>
